WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.568 --> 01:47.032
=Episode 3=
(Lucy Met A Tough Challenge!)

01:48.114 --> 01:49.074
So,

01:50.194 --> 01:51.154
for you,

01:51.315 --> 01:53.435
what makes Xu Zhi
different from other girls

01:53.995 --> 01:56.634
is that she has a boyfriend.

01:58.594 --> 01:59.275
So?

01:59.714 --> 02:00.315
So,

02:00.875 --> 02:03.114
it's not her you can't resist,

02:03.674 --> 02:04.435
but

02:06.674 --> 02:07.435
this kind of

02:08.355 --> 02:09.634
thrill,

02:10.074 --> 02:10.714
a forbidden

02:11.634 --> 02:13.435
and unspeakable

02:14.674 --> 02:17.475
taboo feeling.

02:17.475 --> 02:18.136
Got it?

02:20.315 --> 02:21.554
Chen Luzhou, you're crazy.

02:21.554 --> 02:22.395
Get it treated.

02:23.154 --> 02:24.395
You're the one who's crazy.

02:46.995 --> 02:48.435
Do you have to be so competitive?

02:48.594 --> 02:50.194
Even got up early to have breakfast.

03:00.475 --> 03:01.554
Lovely weather today!

03:01.875 --> 03:02.915
Shall we hang out later?

03:03.795 --> 03:04.395
Fine.

03:05.114 --> 03:06.275
Can we not bring Chen Xingqi?

03:07.714 --> 03:08.216
As you say.

03:08.634 --> 03:09.514
That's fine.

03:19.875 --> 03:20.554
(Where are you?)

03:20.995 --> 03:21.714
(We need to talk.)

03:21.795 --> 03:22.795
(See you at the diner.)

03:29.234 --> 03:29.955
Xu Zhi?

03:32.514 --> 03:33.594
I must warn you.

03:33.995 --> 03:34.915
Be careful of traps.

03:42.475 --> 03:43.435
Oh, Chen Luzhou,

03:44.074 --> 03:45.074
you're hopeless.

03:49.835 --> 03:50.424
Morning.

03:51.034 --> 03:51.995
Good morning.

03:52.355 --> 03:53.074
Morning, morning.

03:55.955 --> 03:56.755
Morning, Mr. Fu.

03:57.514 --> 03:58.072
Morning.

04:00.755 --> 04:02.395
How is it? Is the breakfast good?

04:03.714 --> 04:04.315
It's okay.

04:04.955 --> 04:06.154
Even if not, it's just so.

04:10.034 --> 04:10.955
I heard

04:11.594 --> 04:12.594
you've done commercials.

04:14.355 --> 04:14.904
Yes.

04:16.194 --> 04:17.154
Do one for me.

04:21.755 --> 04:22.875
Touch up his makeup.

04:29.315 --> 04:30.034
Alright, Luzhou,

04:30.034 --> 04:30.755
let's do it again.

04:30.995 --> 04:31.674
Take it easy.

04:31.875 --> 04:32.915
Don't be nervous.

04:34.475 --> 04:35.554
Yes, smile just like that.

04:35.674 --> 04:36.594
Look at me and smile.

04:37.594 --> 04:38.634
That's right.

04:38.955 --> 04:40.714
Not bad, it's very good.

04:41.915 --> 04:42.514
Up to here.

04:42.835 --> 04:44.154
Don't be nervous, Luzhou.

04:44.674 --> 04:45.554
Yes, look at me.

04:46.435 --> 04:47.795
Good, come on, give me a smile.

04:48.435 --> 04:50.594
Very good, keep it up.

04:50.995 --> 04:51.875
Boy,

04:52.154 --> 04:53.514
are you here to film a commercial?

04:53.674 --> 04:54.714
You are so cute.

04:55.554 --> 04:56.915
Such a cute little boy.

04:57.315 --> 04:58.114
Give me a kiss.

04:58.634 --> 05:00.034
You are too cute.

05:02.154 --> 05:03.915
- Bye.
- Bye-bye, little boy.

05:10.554 --> 05:11.154
No.

05:11.514 --> 05:12.154
Why?

05:13.114 --> 05:14.034
I'll pay you.

05:14.835 --> 05:15.634
Three thousand.

05:15.755 --> 05:16.714
It's not about money.

05:17.275 --> 05:17.880
You...

05:20.514 --> 05:21.955
Zhi said,

05:22.315 --> 05:23.194
you need money.

05:23.194 --> 05:24.355
Isn't this an opportunity?

05:24.955 --> 05:26.154
Besides, you are suitable.

05:30.835 --> 05:31.875
I do want to make money,

05:32.034 --> 05:33.955
but I'm not yet
at the point of selling my looks

05:33.955 --> 05:34.875
to make money.

05:37.234 --> 05:38.475
You're overthinking it.

05:38.875 --> 05:40.074
Mr. Fu just wants you

05:40.154 --> 05:41.755
to film a tea garden commercial

05:41.915 --> 05:43.514
with your photography equipment.

05:51.234 --> 05:51.875
Alright.

05:53.194 --> 05:53.915
It's a deal.

05:54.475 --> 05:55.634
Bring your equipment

05:56.194 --> 05:56.795
to the garden.

06:03.634 --> 06:04.634
Take care, Mr. Fu.

06:08.634 --> 06:09.755
Why did you take this gig?

06:10.674 --> 06:11.755
Didn't we agree on it?

06:12.154 --> 06:13.435
If I find a way to make money,

06:13.594 --> 06:14.275
I'd take you.

06:14.674 --> 06:16.355
I keep my word.

06:18.074 --> 06:19.194
I remind you.

06:19.915 --> 06:21.594
Mr. Fu's money isn't that easy to earn.

06:22.154 --> 06:22.808
Keep it up!

06:23.875 --> 06:24.472
I'm leaving.

06:25.634 --> 06:27.634
(Cast a long line to catch a big fish!)

06:27.634 --> 06:28.154
Bye-bye.

06:28.594 --> 06:29.154
Bye-bye.

06:34.114 --> 06:35.714
This girl is interesting.

06:58.400 --> 07:00.064
♪When the summer breeze blows♪

07:01.574 --> 07:07.366
♪We don't think about the fallen leaves,
just want to remember this moment♪

07:08.736 --> 07:11.520
♪With you, I actually
start looking forward to rainy days♪

07:12.896 --> 07:16.518
♪You are like an umbrella,
always catching the raindrops♪

07:17.318 --> 07:20.931
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

07:21.926 --> 07:24.514
♪Only a passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

07:25.821 --> 07:27.031
♪Can beat the night♪

07:27.654 --> 07:29.452
♪We can outrun time♪

07:32.349 --> 07:34.541
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

07:36.253 --> 07:38.510
♪All blend into our season♪

08:05.664 --> 08:07.024
She's so tired.

08:08.024 --> 08:08.705
Drink some water.

08:10.385 --> 08:12.024
Give a bottle to Mr. Chen later.

08:12.865 --> 08:13.544
Mr. Fu,

08:14.064 --> 08:15.745
I am both a model and a gofer.

08:16.144 --> 08:17.984
Even the bee can't work like this.

08:18.945 --> 08:20.384
Do you know how they work?

08:20.465 --> 08:21.062
Help me.

08:24.465 --> 08:25.024
Come on.

08:27.104 --> 08:28.905
Calling you two over to be models

08:29.304 --> 08:30.344
wasn't my idea.

08:31.505 --> 08:32.184
He suggested it?

08:34.344 --> 08:36.264
He doesn't want to hinder
tea farmers' progress.

08:36.945 --> 08:38.745
So he called you two over.

08:41.304 --> 08:41.905
Well,

08:42.224 --> 08:44.184
I, the boss, am right here.

08:44.705 --> 08:46.465
I can give these workers a day off

08:46.545 --> 08:47.304
to film.

08:48.024 --> 08:49.064
But he insists not to.

08:49.705 --> 08:51.505
He just hides in a little corner,

08:51.745 --> 08:53.344
not interfering with their work.

08:53.905 --> 08:54.825
That's interesting.

08:56.264 --> 08:57.625
Completely unlike his brother.

09:06.745 --> 09:07.545
Quite unusual.

09:07.984 --> 09:08.545
That's right.

09:09.224 --> 09:10.585
Quite unusually bad.

09:12.224 --> 09:13.465
The lines

09:13.585 --> 09:14.545
are all messed up.

09:14.785 --> 09:16.785
The lack of basic skills
is completely exposed.

09:17.625 --> 09:19.705
Even worse than my work
in primary school.

09:19.865 --> 09:21.785
I think your appreciation level
is lacking.

09:22.024 --> 09:22.825
Kids,

09:23.384 --> 09:25.144
come on, look over here.

09:26.184 --> 09:27.024
This is the new work

09:27.024 --> 09:29.825
(Monkey King)
of our great artist, Mr. Chen.

09:30.144 --> 09:31.104
Everyone, take a look.

09:32.184 --> 09:33.344
Take it as a warning.

09:34.625 --> 09:35.545
Return it to me.

09:36.945 --> 09:38.024
If you say one more word,

09:38.304 --> 09:39.384
I'll fire you.

09:39.465 --> 09:40.865
You fire me?

09:41.304 --> 09:42.945
I'm saying this for your own good, okay?

09:43.304 --> 09:44.505
Better than you

09:44.984 --> 09:46.224
not getting into college.

09:46.825 --> 09:48.144
You're cursing me?

09:48.785 --> 09:50.064
I'm going to tell my brother.

09:50.224 --> 09:51.384
Telling him is useless.

09:52.144 --> 09:54.545
He will only say things
that sound worse than I do.

09:55.665 --> 09:56.865
Looks really good.

09:57.104 --> 09:57.945
Zhi, look.

10:01.745 --> 10:03.625
I've looked at this face
for so many years,

10:03.705 --> 10:05.144
I should get used to it.

10:05.304 --> 10:05.945
How annoying!

10:06.344 --> 10:07.625
I'm still amazed by you.

10:08.465 --> 10:09.505
But I have to say,

10:09.505 --> 10:11.545
Mr. Chen is really biased.

10:11.825 --> 10:13.224
So many close-ups of Zhi,

10:13.505 --> 10:14.984
yet not a single direct shot of me.

10:16.545 --> 10:17.062
No,

10:17.264 --> 10:18.384
take a few more shots of me.

10:18.625 --> 10:19.224
Well,

10:20.264 --> 10:21.585
take a picture of me there.

10:22.144 --> 10:22.785
Right here?

10:23.625 --> 10:24.545
But the background...

10:24.545 --> 10:25.384
It's okay.

10:26.224 --> 10:27.505
I won't draw anymore, okay?

10:27.625 --> 10:28.984
Fine, don't draw anymore.

10:30.945 --> 10:31.526
Wait...

10:33.665 --> 10:34.344
Are you okay?

10:35.625 --> 10:36.424
Who is there?

10:37.505 --> 10:38.705
Chen Xingqi, put it down.

10:38.984 --> 10:39.545
Move aside.

10:39.545 --> 10:40.070
Put it down.

10:40.505 --> 10:41.104
Put it down.

10:41.104 --> 10:41.625
Move aside.

10:41.625 --> 10:42.825
Put it down!

10:50.184 --> 10:51.465
Monkey King.

10:52.264 --> 10:53.465
Who is the Monkey King?

10:57.144 --> 10:57.785
Apologize.

11:00.384 --> 11:01.465
Why should I apologize?

11:03.024 --> 11:04.184
He bullied me first.

11:05.104 --> 11:06.705
How come you accuse me?

11:06.705 --> 11:08.024
I didn't force you to throw it.

11:08.344 --> 11:09.705
Apologize, Chen Xingqi.

11:10.625 --> 11:12.024
Why are you siding with outsiders?

11:12.304 --> 11:13.384
I'm your brother.

11:13.984 --> 11:15.224
Why help others bully me?

11:15.705 --> 11:16.505
You won't apologize?

11:17.505 --> 11:19.264
Fine, I'll apologize for you.

11:19.705 --> 11:21.264
Pack your things and go home.

11:21.865 --> 11:23.384
You just want to drive me away.

11:24.424 --> 11:25.104
I get it.

11:25.825 --> 11:26.865
You're just a bully.

11:27.945 --> 11:28.825
You hate me

11:29.984 --> 11:30.865
and want me gone.

11:35.104 --> 11:36.465
Hey, Troublemaker,

11:36.465 --> 11:37.785
why are you crying again?

11:38.865 --> 11:40.184
You're making it seem like we all

11:40.184 --> 11:41.184
picked on you.

11:41.865 --> 11:43.424
Clearly you threw things first.

11:43.825 --> 11:44.984
And it almost hit her.

11:45.184 --> 11:47.064
Mr. Fu will settle the score with you.

11:48.024 --> 11:48.625
No, he won't.

11:49.424 --> 11:51.304
Mr. Fu said
he can understand quite well.

11:53.064 --> 11:53.785
He said that?

11:55.424 --> 11:56.984
In his own words, he said

11:57.224 --> 11:58.024
if this were his,

11:58.344 --> 11:59.705
he'd throw it too.

12:01.865 --> 12:02.424
Great!

12:03.304 --> 12:03.814
Great!

12:04.705 --> 12:05.585
Too great!

12:05.585 --> 12:06.705
Okay.

12:08.785 --> 12:09.905
Just you wait.

12:10.064 --> 12:10.598
Hey.

12:10.865 --> 12:11.465
Chen Xingqi.

12:15.585 --> 12:17.024
Forget it, no need to apologize.

12:17.384 --> 12:18.825
Just remember to slim me down a bit.

12:19.825 --> 12:20.825
Come on, let's go.

12:20.945 --> 12:21.825
It's too hot.

12:29.705 --> 12:30.865
I think this Xu Zhi

12:30.865 --> 12:31.825
is quite okay.

12:33.264 --> 12:34.705
If she becomes your girlfriend,

12:35.424 --> 12:37.144
she could keep Chen Xingqi in check.

12:38.545 --> 12:39.945
I think you are crazy.

12:40.745 --> 12:41.705
Where are you going?

12:41.984 --> 12:44.264
Coax my boss,
or else later he'll complain to my mom.

12:44.264 --> 12:44.902
Wait for me!

12:49.184 --> 12:49.984
It feels good!

12:50.384 --> 12:52.064
As satisfying as handling a bratty kid.

12:54.144 --> 12:55.745
Actually, I didn't intend to say it.

12:56.545 --> 12:57.304
You know,

12:57.745 --> 12:58.545
Mr. Fu's words

12:58.625 --> 12:59.865
also have considerable impact.

13:00.545 --> 13:01.264
But...

13:01.665 --> 13:03.545
But you don't want
to embarrass Chen Luzhou,

13:03.945 --> 13:05.505
so you showed your trump card.

13:06.545 --> 13:07.224
Sort of.

13:09.745 --> 13:11.424
Actually, I think your guess is correct.

13:12.224 --> 13:13.945
Chen Luzhou might have been adopted.

13:14.184 --> 13:15.264
His brother

13:15.384 --> 13:16.264
is so arrogant.

13:16.264 --> 13:17.585
They don't look like family.

13:21.785 --> 13:22.745
Feeling sorry?

13:24.825 --> 13:26.024
I was just thinking

13:26.625 --> 13:28.144
if that's really the case,

13:29.384 --> 13:31.264
what kind of person is his mother?

13:33.184 --> 13:34.224
Don't overthink it.

13:34.465 --> 13:35.745
You'll know once you meet.

13:36.064 --> 13:36.585
Zhi,

13:37.104 --> 13:38.224
considering you

13:38.224 --> 13:39.625
helped me out,

13:39.745 --> 13:40.785
I'll treat you to a spa.

13:41.304 --> 13:42.024
No need.

13:42.585 --> 13:45.064
I just want to lie down on my bed
and rest now.

13:45.865 --> 13:47.785
I'll just enjoy it on my own.

13:47.785 --> 13:48.865
Don't regret it later.

13:49.905 --> 13:50.825
Go ahead.

13:54.024 --> 13:54.984
You're really leaving?

14:00.705 --> 14:01.785
He wears your clothes.

14:01.984 --> 14:03.064
Because he admires you.

14:04.304 --> 14:05.144
You know,

14:05.745 --> 14:07.705
every time he invites classmates over,

14:07.785 --> 14:09.665
he always takes them to your room

14:09.825 --> 14:11.344
to see your trophies.

14:12.064 --> 14:13.505
Really? He admires me?

14:14.224 --> 14:15.585
Why did he discard my gifts?

14:17.785 --> 14:19.705
So you dampen his confidence,
is that it?

14:20.264 --> 14:22.304
That was just an objective assessment.

14:23.144 --> 14:24.545
If he can't even take that,

14:24.545 --> 14:26.024
how will he face the adult world?

14:26.745 --> 14:28.264
Chen Xingqi isn't as smart as you.

14:29.104 --> 14:30.905
He can't achieve everything he wants.

14:32.344 --> 14:34.384
He grew up in your shadow.

14:34.585 --> 14:35.945
So he needs more protection.

14:36.745 --> 14:37.424
So?

14:38.344 --> 14:39.264
Weakness means right?

14:40.024 --> 14:40.705
Chen Luzhou,

14:41.304 --> 14:42.465
could you be reasonable?

14:43.344 --> 14:44.545
I'm very busy with work.

14:44.545 --> 14:45.304
I don't have time

14:45.304 --> 14:46.984
for the grudges between you three men.

14:47.705 --> 14:48.224
Fine,

14:48.705 --> 14:50.344
please endure it for two more months.

14:50.344 --> 14:51.104
After I go abroad,

14:51.184 --> 14:52.505
I won't be an eyesore to you.

15:10.064 --> 15:11.625
How long do you plan to eavesdrop?

15:22.465 --> 15:23.984
You love hearing people being scolded.

15:26.545 --> 15:27.545
I didn't mean to.

15:28.945 --> 15:30.224
Anyway, it's not the first time.

15:52.992 --> 15:54.990
♪In the darkness,
you are like fireworks♪

15:56.672 --> 15:58.491
♪An untouchable silhouette♪

15:59.008 --> 16:01.298
♪How much time is needed♪

16:01.792 --> 16:04.451
♪To vividly sketch♪

16:06.586 --> 16:08.506
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

16:08.800 --> 16:10.105
♪Remains in the heart♪

16:11.264 --> 16:13.216
♪You will fulfill the past♪

16:13.216 --> 16:15.296
♪Dream you long for♪

16:15.296 --> 16:18.616
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

16:19.168 --> 16:21.880
♪Together with you♪

16:22.360 --> 16:24.092
♪Look, this city♪

16:24.384 --> 16:25.625
Actually, I quite envy you.

16:27.665 --> 16:28.505
Envy me for what?

16:29.785 --> 16:30.505
Getting scolded?

16:33.545 --> 16:34.825
You have Stockholm syndrome?

16:40.425 --> 16:41.705
My mom used to be like that too.

16:42.585 --> 16:43.944
She never spoke nicely,

16:45.104 --> 16:47.064
always with sarcasm.

16:48.064 --> 16:49.625
She also loved to nag.

16:49.825 --> 16:50.825
A bit bossy.

16:55.344 --> 16:56.825
But later I realized,

16:57.745 --> 17:00.024
she always tries her hardest

17:00.344 --> 17:01.505
to express her concern.

17:03.545 --> 17:04.865
But when she tries to speak,

17:05.264 --> 17:06.224
it comes out wrong.

17:07.865 --> 17:09.705
But it doesn't mean she doesn't love me.

17:17.785 --> 17:18.505
You're right,

17:20.825 --> 17:22.545
but some people become family because

17:23.465 --> 17:25.505
it's a mutual exchange of needs
from the start.

17:29.905 --> 17:31.264
Why are you sighing?

17:31.344 --> 17:32.264
And not eating well?

17:33.024 --> 17:33.585
What's wrong?

17:34.344 --> 17:35.304
Grandma said,

17:36.104 --> 17:37.865
you took me from the orphanage

17:39.184 --> 17:40.865
just to avert disaster for my brother.

17:43.224 --> 17:44.064
Is it true?

17:49.984 --> 17:51.425
True or not, it doesn't matter.

17:51.905 --> 17:52.625
Chen Luzhou,

17:52.905 --> 17:54.745
do you want to stay with me forever?

17:56.545 --> 17:57.384
Then in this family,

17:57.384 --> 17:59.104
you must listen to Grandma and Dad.

18:00.585 --> 18:01.384
Got it?

18:12.465 --> 18:14.425
All exchanges are conditional.

18:17.064 --> 18:18.625
As long as you disappoint them,

18:19.264 --> 18:20.224
you will be discarded.

18:22.384 --> 18:25.465
Thank you both
for taking care of Luzhou.

18:25.745 --> 18:26.505
No trouble.

18:26.865 --> 18:28.984
Mr. Chen, I truly envy you.

18:29.224 --> 18:30.184
Once Luzhou graduates,

18:30.425 --> 18:31.465
you'll have a successor.

18:32.545 --> 18:33.745
Not like my kid,

18:33.905 --> 18:34.665
he falls short.

18:35.505 --> 18:36.705
If he didn't make trouble,

18:36.705 --> 18:37.905
I'd be thankful for that.

18:38.665 --> 18:40.224
I'm not sure if I'll return.

18:43.384 --> 18:44.785
I know nothing about management.

18:45.905 --> 18:46.745
I won't come back

18:47.705 --> 18:48.825
to cause trouble for my dad.

18:53.745 --> 18:54.865
I'll go to the restroom.

18:55.224 --> 18:56.024
You guys eat.

18:56.104 --> 18:56.825
Are you okay?

18:59.184 --> 19:00.184
You guys eat first.

19:00.905 --> 19:01.865
Look at you.

19:10.024 --> 19:12.064
What do you mean
you'll cause me trouble?

19:15.865 --> 19:16.545
Chen Luzhou,

19:18.104 --> 19:19.825
what's with your sarcastic tone?

19:21.224 --> 19:22.064
Do you know?

19:22.545 --> 19:25.024
Studying abroad is something
many people can't even dream of.

19:25.585 --> 19:26.425
Remember,

19:27.064 --> 19:28.745
it's all your luck that you can live

19:28.745 --> 19:29.705
such a life today.

19:30.665 --> 19:31.465
Stop talking.

19:35.104 --> 19:35.625
Yes.

19:36.944 --> 19:37.785
I'm lucky.

19:39.905 --> 19:40.625
Thank you.

19:41.665 --> 19:42.465
And I thank my mom.

19:43.465 --> 19:45.104
Of course, I need to thank Chen Xingqi.

19:46.585 --> 19:48.064
Without him, there wouldn't be me.

19:52.505 --> 19:53.304
You two,

19:53.425 --> 19:54.545
say less.

19:57.984 --> 20:00.144
Since you know better than anyone else,

20:05.545 --> 20:06.944
you should know

20:08.264 --> 20:09.425
what to do

20:11.505 --> 20:12.745
and what not to do.

20:12.745 --> 20:14.264
Alright, go back and sit down.

20:16.465 --> 20:17.944
Worried I won't repay your kindness?

20:18.465 --> 20:19.944
I can write you a guarantee.

20:23.705 --> 20:24.984
You've raised me.

20:25.825 --> 20:26.344
Don't worry,

20:27.024 --> 20:28.304
whether I'm abroad or not,

20:28.865 --> 20:30.224
I'll care for you in your old age.

20:39.745 --> 20:42.304
Dad, this time
you didn't perform well, right?

20:55.425 --> 20:56.144
Before leaving,

20:56.545 --> 20:57.705
what did I tell you?

20:58.665 --> 21:00.905
Keep quiet while riding with you,

21:02.825 --> 21:04.545
and don't disturb the clients.

21:04.865 --> 21:05.465
That's right.

21:06.144 --> 21:06.984
It's okay, boy.

21:07.905 --> 21:08.625
Go play.

21:09.304 --> 21:10.505
I'm sorry.

21:11.505 --> 21:13.465
I promise not to bother you anymore.

21:14.465 --> 21:17.224
Please don't give my dad
a bad review, okay?

21:17.224 --> 21:17.785
I won't.

21:18.064 --> 21:19.425
I'll give your dad five stars.

21:20.264 --> 21:21.224
Thank you.

21:23.825 --> 21:24.825
I'm sorry.

21:25.264 --> 21:26.224
It's okay.

21:29.224 --> 21:29.984
You brat,

21:30.465 --> 21:31.264
be quiet.

21:44.825 --> 21:46.064
Being loved unconditionally

21:46.505 --> 21:47.465
requires luck.

21:54.465 --> 21:55.006
Let's go,

21:55.465 --> 21:56.184
follow me.

22:14.785 --> 22:15.465
Hurry up.

22:16.825 --> 22:18.505
I'll introduce you to my old friend.

22:27.665 --> 22:28.425
Is this yours?

22:29.344 --> 22:29.886
Yes.

22:33.064 --> 22:33.745
Put it on.

22:38.384 --> 22:39.944
You test boundaries of the law,

22:39.944 --> 22:40.705
why involve me too?

22:41.465 --> 22:43.425
I am a certified professional.

22:58.465 --> 22:59.184
Sit tight.

23:03.872 --> 23:08.132
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

23:10.336 --> 23:18.776
♪The reflection in your eyes,
a brilliant scenery♪

23:19.232 --> 23:23.896
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

23:26.266 --> 23:33.359
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

23:35.136 --> 23:40.474
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

23:42.848 --> 23:47.954
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

23:52.416 --> 23:53.937
Are you feeling better now?

24:05.017 --> 24:05.697
Wait a moment.

24:17.937 --> 24:18.536
Here.

24:20.256 --> 24:20.862
This...

24:23.416 --> 24:25.097
Now you have what I have.

24:32.937 --> 24:33.496
Luck.

24:35.017 --> 24:36.097
Being loved unconditionally

24:36.697 --> 24:37.496
requires luck.

24:46.576 --> 24:47.136
Forget it.

24:48.057 --> 24:49.376
Let's talk at the bar later.

24:50.857 --> 24:51.376
What?

24:52.937 --> 24:53.777
I thought

24:53.777 --> 24:54.817
you don't drink?

24:55.857 --> 24:56.937
Actually,

24:58.017 --> 24:59.216
it's hard to talk about it

25:00.176 --> 25:01.256
without a bit of alcohol.

25:03.416 --> 25:04.136
(Is she...)

25:05.296 --> 25:06.937
(Is she going to confess to me?)

26:02.336 --> 26:02.897
No thanks.

26:03.937 --> 26:04.657
Just drink.

26:05.456 --> 26:06.657
Without drinking a bit,

26:06.737 --> 26:07.496
I can't continue.

26:08.176 --> 26:09.456
I'm afraid you won't listen.

26:16.336 --> 26:17.136
A cup of lemon tea.

26:23.136 --> 26:24.416
I know what you want to say.

26:25.576 --> 26:26.216
You know?

26:28.777 --> 26:29.977
I can somewhat guess.

26:30.576 --> 26:31.817
Do I still need to say it then?

26:34.617 --> 26:36.376
Alright, let's talk
when Yingying arrives.

26:36.376 --> 26:36.894
Xu Zhi.

26:37.416 --> 26:38.416
Xu Zhi, I'm here.

26:38.496 --> 26:39.006
She's here.

26:40.536 --> 26:41.097
I'm here.

26:45.376 --> 26:46.496
Waiter, a pot of water.

26:46.937 --> 26:48.496
He insisted on joining in the fun.

26:49.697 --> 26:50.897
Why is the vibe so strange?

26:51.097 --> 26:52.017
She'll confess to you?

26:53.576 --> 26:54.216
I'll say it.

27:04.657 --> 27:05.182
Wait.

27:08.176 --> 27:09.097
My shoelace is loose.

27:10.097 --> 27:11.697
I actually just want to meet your mom.

27:11.817 --> 27:12.857
No matter how.

27:24.136 --> 27:26.136
Now I've added you.
When can I visit your house?

27:27.097 --> 27:28.376
Is your mom home?

27:28.897 --> 27:30.136
Next time your mom comes,

27:30.496 --> 27:31.617
remember to save me a seat.

27:32.176 --> 27:33.977
Does your mom usually
come to cook for you?

27:34.456 --> 27:35.416
You want a free meal?

27:35.617 --> 27:36.336
Is it okay?

27:43.376 --> 27:45.617
What does "no matter how" mean?

27:46.097 --> 27:47.136
It means

27:47.897 --> 27:50.176
if you want Xu Zhi
to be your girlfriend,

27:50.256 --> 27:52.176
only then will she see your mom,

27:52.256 --> 27:53.017
she would agree.

28:02.697 --> 28:04.057
Do you think I like you?

28:04.296 --> 28:04.937
No,

28:05.617 --> 28:07.216
I'm definitely not that narcissistic.

28:07.657 --> 28:09.496
Moreover, I have no other intentions.

28:10.017 --> 28:11.376
I added you on WeChat,

28:11.857 --> 28:13.977
also hoping to meet your mom.

28:14.576 --> 28:15.176
That's all.

28:22.136 --> 28:24.256
I didn't disturb you on WeChat.

28:24.344 --> 28:28.456
Take a look.
I haven't opened your Moments.

28:33.057 --> 28:35.216
Chen Luzhou, it's an "L".

28:36.376 --> 28:37.456
Thanks.

28:37.924 --> 28:38.590
(Chen Ruzhou)

28:38.852 --> 28:39.660
(Data Settings)

28:39.851 --> 28:40.446
(Set Tags)

28:42.216 --> 28:43.657
(Don't lose it, stay calm.)

28:44.017 --> 28:45.737
(This might be)

28:45.737 --> 28:47.536
(an advanced flirting trick.)

28:47.812 --> 28:49.230
(Chen Luzhou)

28:52.857 --> 28:54.296
Why did you break up with your ex?

28:55.017 --> 28:55.897
What ex?

28:56.576 --> 28:58.697
(Don't make grand excuses for yourself.)

28:59.176 --> 29:00.456
(Do you dare say you have)

29:00.697 --> 29:02.737
(no interest in me?)

29:02.857 --> 29:04.897
Right, why did you break up with him?

29:06.456 --> 29:08.017
My bad, my bad.

29:08.216 --> 29:08.937
Let me explain.

29:12.376 --> 29:14.296
Xu Zhi doesn't have a boyfriend.

29:16.017 --> 29:18.496
We were just afraid
you wouldn't hang out with us,

29:18.937 --> 29:20.416
so we lied to you.

29:24.216 --> 29:24.766
Alright.

29:24.766 --> 29:25.617
You lied to me?

29:25.617 --> 29:26.576
No sound.

29:26.897 --> 29:28.176
So what if she lied to you?

29:28.416 --> 29:29.057
Alright.

29:29.176 --> 29:29.977
Let go.

29:29.977 --> 29:31.017
Why...

29:31.617 --> 29:32.897
Why don't you hear about my mom?

29:33.376 --> 29:33.977
Alright.

29:34.416 --> 29:35.536
Sorry, sorry everyone.

29:35.536 --> 29:36.176
Please.

29:36.176 --> 29:36.977
Or you'd think

29:36.977 --> 29:38.216
Xu Zhi liked you.

29:38.617 --> 29:39.134
Right?

29:39.134 --> 29:39.742
You guys chat.

29:40.697 --> 29:41.857
What are you doing?

29:41.857 --> 29:42.536
You guys chat.

29:42.777 --> 29:44.256
Yingying drank too much.

29:44.256 --> 29:45.296
Don't listen to her.

29:49.617 --> 29:50.336
So, your mom.

29:51.977 --> 29:53.097
What about her?

29:57.256 --> 29:58.697
You were going to talk about her?

30:01.657 --> 30:03.176
I also find it incredible.

30:03.576 --> 30:05.057
Their voices and tones

30:05.057 --> 30:06.057
are exactly the same.

30:06.937 --> 30:07.937
If you don't mind,

30:07.937 --> 30:09.057
can you take me to your mom?

30:09.376 --> 30:10.256
Just once.

30:19.416 --> 30:20.456
As my girlfriend?

30:25.057 --> 30:26.136
As long as you don't mind.

30:26.576 --> 30:28.456
We two pretend to be a couple then.

30:28.456 --> 30:28.990
Right?

30:29.777 --> 30:30.536
Why should I?

30:32.376 --> 30:33.296
Pretend to be in love.

30:33.657 --> 30:34.536
I don't want to.

30:36.017 --> 30:37.216
I don't want to date either.

30:39.376 --> 30:40.857
Xu Zhi,

30:41.017 --> 30:42.697
I don't want to play with him.

30:42.817 --> 30:43.817
Take care.

30:46.296 --> 30:47.057
What's wrong?

30:48.097 --> 30:49.376
Is this alcohol allergy?

30:49.376 --> 30:50.256
Let me take a look.

30:50.697 --> 30:51.296
It hurts.

30:51.296 --> 30:51.870
Where?

30:53.256 --> 30:54.496
Heart pain.

30:55.017 --> 30:56.057
Any heart condition?

30:56.496 --> 30:57.017
No.

30:58.576 --> 31:00.617
It's time for my depression.

31:03.897 --> 31:04.857
Sorry.

31:05.256 --> 31:06.336
She drank too much.

31:06.536 --> 31:07.296
We should go.

31:07.456 --> 31:08.536
Why now?

31:08.617 --> 31:09.817
It's time to take medicine.

31:10.416 --> 31:11.777
What medicine? Is it tasty?

31:11.777 --> 31:12.496
- You guess.
- Bye.

31:19.336 --> 31:19.977
Lucy.

31:20.456 --> 31:21.536
After we left,

31:21.536 --> 31:22.737
what did you talk about?

31:40.057 --> 31:41.336
Stop it.

31:43.697 --> 31:44.536
So, you know,

31:45.456 --> 31:47.657
one cannot be too stuck
in habitual thinking.

31:48.296 --> 31:49.977
You see, although since childhood,

31:50.336 --> 31:52.336
so many girls
have shown interest in you,

31:53.256 --> 31:54.536
not all girls

31:54.617 --> 31:55.977
will be moved by you, right?

31:56.857 --> 31:58.097
Lucy, Lucy.

31:58.697 --> 32:00.817
This time, you've met a tough one.

32:01.376 --> 32:01.937
And

32:02.416 --> 32:03.857
you can't even refuse her.

32:11.496 --> 32:12.657
The air is cleared.

32:12.977 --> 32:14.057
Do you still have

32:14.416 --> 32:15.456
that tingly feeling

32:15.737 --> 32:16.937
that you can't refuse?

32:18.336 --> 32:19.817
Zhu Yangqi, if you don't shower now,

32:20.817 --> 32:22.176
there will be no hot water.

32:24.737 --> 32:25.278
Alright,

32:25.697 --> 32:26.216
I'll go.

32:38.176 --> 32:40.576
Are you crazy? Stop it.

32:43.716 --> 32:46.991
(Yuechang Cola)

32:53.176 --> 32:54.496
(Qiqi: I'm from class 9.)

32:54.657 --> 32:55.897
(Can I add you?)

33:02.072 --> 33:05.455
(Xu Zhi, Nickname:
Gardenia Doesn't Want to Bloom.)

33:05.617 --> 33:08.017
(I didn't disturb you)

33:08.017 --> 33:09.136
(on WeChat.)

33:09.496 --> 33:11.017
(I haven't opened your Moments.)

33:14.176 --> 33:16.857
(Well, speak for yourself. I'm not you.)

33:18.648 --> 33:25.534
(Xu Zhi's Moments)

33:30.336 --> 33:31.057
(Xu Zhi: Hello.)

33:36.344 --> 33:40.880
(Xu Zhi: Hello.)

33:45.136 --> 33:46.456
(Anything else?)

33:46.777 --> 33:48.977
(Actually, I was lying to you just now.)

33:55.332 --> 33:56.137
(Chat Screenshot)

33:58.697 --> 34:00.576
(Yingying said
she left her bag at the bar.)

34:00.777 --> 34:02.296
(She asked if you guys saw it.)

34:02.296 --> 34:03.336
(But now it's found.)

34:13.256 --> 34:14.657
What was I expecting?

34:23.605 --> 34:26.366
(Rushi Qingzuo)

34:26.737 --> 34:28.136
What is this?

34:28.256 --> 34:28.857
Watch it.

34:31.176 --> 34:32.697
It's fine, keep drawing.

34:33.536 --> 34:34.897
That's pretty good.

34:37.657 --> 34:39.256
Relax a bit, everyone, relax a bit.

34:39.256 --> 34:39.897
Don't be tense.

34:46.817 --> 34:47.536
Mosquitoes.

34:47.857 --> 34:48.857
Sorry.

34:49.737 --> 34:50.416
Go on.

34:50.576 --> 34:51.737
It's just a mosquito.

34:51.937 --> 34:53.057
Keep drawing, keep drawing.

34:53.576 --> 34:55.097
Is the model you hired okay?

34:55.496 --> 34:56.376
Where are mosquitoes?

34:56.817 --> 34:57.857
Why haven't I been bitten?

35:01.857 --> 35:02.536
What is this?

35:03.416 --> 35:04.176
A mosquito.

35:04.817 --> 35:05.897
So disgusting.

35:07.216 --> 35:07.777
Kids,

35:08.097 --> 35:08.937
do you see it?

35:09.216 --> 35:10.737
That's what outdoor sketching is like.

35:10.857 --> 35:11.416
Sometimes,

35:11.416 --> 35:13.136
there are bugs and mosquitoes
everywhere.

35:13.857 --> 35:14.937
As great artists,

35:15.057 --> 35:16.097
we'd learn to overcome it,

35:16.496 --> 35:17.216
got it?

35:17.416 --> 35:18.857
Miss, go on.

35:20.336 --> 35:21.216
This stroke of yours.

35:23.637 --> 35:25.086
(Zhai Xiao)

35:28.097 --> 35:29.496
It's okay. Just a call.

35:30.136 --> 35:31.296
Keep drawing. Come on.

35:41.336 --> 35:42.376
I should take it.

35:42.576 --> 35:43.697
Sorry.

35:43.857 --> 35:44.456
Keep drawing.

35:48.416 --> 35:49.376
Yingying, you...

35:49.376 --> 35:49.897
Sir,

35:50.617 --> 35:51.576
the model has left.

35:52.136 --> 35:53.017
What do we draw?

35:53.097 --> 35:53.817
She's gone.

35:54.496 --> 35:55.697
Are you sure?

35:56.057 --> 35:57.336
Draw what?

35:57.737 --> 35:58.937
(Spring harvests tender tips.)

35:59.216 --> 36:00.416
(Summer stores essence.)

36:00.777 --> 36:01.977
(Autumn conceals richness.)

36:02.256 --> 36:03.456
(And winter refines aroma.)

36:04.216 --> 36:05.416
(The cycle of four seasons,)

36:05.657 --> 36:06.296
(here,)

36:06.617 --> 36:07.617
(every brew of tea)

36:07.817 --> 36:09.256
(is the whisper of time,)

36:09.456 --> 36:10.657
(the breath of mountains)

36:10.977 --> 36:13.576
(and the perfect fusion
of craftsmanship and nature.)

36:14.256 --> 36:15.336
(Fu Yu Tea Garden)

36:15.617 --> 36:16.977
(invites you to enjoy)

36:16.977 --> 36:18.296
(the gift from the earth.)

36:18.697 --> 36:21.737
(Let the soul dance leisurely
in the aroma of tea.)

36:21.737 --> 36:22.416
It's okay.

36:23.657 --> 36:25.496
Maybe you can handle the editing.

36:26.617 --> 36:27.336
Let me check.

36:27.857 --> 36:28.737
Today is Wednesday.

36:30.256 --> 36:31.456
Can I submit work next week?

36:36.857 --> 36:37.857
Wait.

36:39.857 --> 36:40.376
Tea here.

36:41.657 --> 36:42.174
New tea.

36:42.576 --> 36:43.136
Try it.

37:01.857 --> 37:03.017
Tastes good, right?

37:04.536 --> 37:06.057
Not bad. I don't know much about tea.

37:09.097 --> 37:10.176
It refines our temperament.

37:10.617 --> 37:12.937
I used to be really impatient.

37:13.657 --> 37:15.256
I calmed down thanks to drinking tea.

37:18.937 --> 37:20.376
Who is older, you or Xu Zhi?

37:22.057 --> 37:23.657
We should be of the same age, right?

37:24.977 --> 37:26.017
Which month were you born?

37:26.657 --> 37:27.296
November.

37:29.256 --> 37:30.057
She is July.

37:30.977 --> 37:32.737
You should call her "sister".

37:39.376 --> 37:42.017
You should be filling out
your college applications, right?

37:42.097 --> 37:43.977
What major, photography?

37:44.697 --> 37:45.576
It's just a hobby.

37:46.817 --> 37:47.897
I plan to go abroad.

37:49.176 --> 37:50.496
Why do all want to go abroad?

37:52.057 --> 37:54.057
I'm telling you,
I've been to several countries.

37:54.817 --> 37:55.977
I really think

37:56.136 --> 37:57.817
the domestic environment is quite good.

37:58.256 --> 38:00.576
Going abroad is not
as good as you imagine.

38:01.817 --> 38:02.416
Do you know?

38:04.817 --> 38:05.456
Mr. Fu.

38:07.456 --> 38:08.256
Perfect timing.

38:08.336 --> 38:09.097
Tell him

38:09.097 --> 38:10.496
how good our country is.

38:13.097 --> 38:13.777
Mr. Fu,

38:14.176 --> 38:16.176
everyone has the right to choose freely.

38:16.336 --> 38:17.617
Why do you care what he chooses?

38:17.777 --> 38:18.456
Isn't it so?

38:21.977 --> 38:23.256
I still have something to do.

38:23.336 --> 38:24.136
I'll go back first.

38:32.336 --> 38:33.057
Let's go too.

38:33.857 --> 38:34.416
Let's go.

38:39.097 --> 38:40.336
Let's go out to play.

38:40.697 --> 38:41.256
Let's go.

38:43.376 --> 38:44.336
Chen Luzhou.

38:44.737 --> 38:45.777
Who did you invite?

38:46.296 --> 38:47.617
I just came out to sketch.

38:48.136 --> 38:50.256
Now the teacher and the model are gone.

38:50.697 --> 38:52.136
How am I supposed to draw?

38:52.617 --> 38:53.336
Isn't it perfect?

38:54.057 --> 38:54.977
Pack up your things,

38:54.977 --> 38:56.176
and let's go downhill to home.

38:58.136 --> 38:58.737
Wait...

39:04.017 --> 39:05.336
Chen Luzhou

39:06.176 --> 39:07.617
and I were in a good conversation.

39:08.536 --> 39:10.576
As soon as you came in, he left.

39:11.977 --> 39:13.536
Does he not like you?

39:14.057 --> 39:16.216
Maybe he really has something to do.

39:16.617 --> 39:18.617
He said just now

39:19.737 --> 39:21.336
he'd help you with the editing.

39:21.817 --> 39:23.296
Did you offer him more money?

39:24.017 --> 39:24.817
Keep out of it.

39:25.657 --> 39:27.937
You should learn from Chen Luzhou well.

39:28.097 --> 39:29.817
His mindset,

39:30.657 --> 39:33.536
capturing the beauty
of the world with a camera.

39:34.416 --> 39:36.737
Even pheasants he shoots are in pairs.

39:37.857 --> 39:38.897
Now look at you.

39:39.296 --> 39:40.857
You should talk more about things

39:41.097 --> 39:43.817
like the world, ideals and such.

39:44.256 --> 39:45.416
No more money talk.

39:45.977 --> 39:46.494
Vulgar.

39:46.494 --> 39:48.336
You just don't want to give him a raise.

39:48.777 --> 39:50.057
He didn't ask.

39:50.216 --> 39:50.977
Why do you care?

39:51.817 --> 39:53.057
Why shouldn't I?

39:53.216 --> 39:55.296
It's my responsibility.
I introduced him to you.

39:55.937 --> 39:56.817
I think...

39:57.897 --> 40:00.536
you should get it down to written form

40:01.057 --> 40:01.897
to avoid any default.

40:05.017 --> 40:06.977
(Aren't you not interested in me?)

40:06.977 --> 40:09.136
(Why are you defending me?)

40:38.782 --> 40:44.638
(Being loved unconditionally
requires a bit of luck.)

40:45.504 --> 40:51.320
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

40:51.872 --> 40:57.400
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

